        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Dream</strong></h2>You had a dream, but you discovered you can't wake up.<br><br>In this strange dreamscape woven from Chinese nostalgia, childhood memories, and liminal spaces, everything reasonable yet unreasonable will happen. You can only explore step by step and finally choose whether to return to that bustling, real-world city...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Styles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Core:</strong> Chinese Dreamcore, Liminal Space, Nostalgic Tear-jerker<br></li><li> <strong>Other Styles:</strong> Kidcore, Oldcore, Concretecore, Toiletcore, Frutiger Aero, Y2K</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Gameplay</strong></h2>The core of &quot;Strange Dream&quot; is immersive atmospheric exploration, but it is by no means limited to a walking simulator. Scattered throughout the dream are various fun minigame levels waiting for you to discover. Every exploration may bring an unexpected surprise.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Us to Build the Dream Together!</strong></h2><strong>Game Updates/Discussion QQ Group: 1032181602</strong><br><br>To all our backers and viewers! The game is expected to be released on October 29th. Before the release, there will be a giveaway event for free activation codes! The more wishlists we get, the more codes we'll give away! Please be sure to join the group to see the announcements~<br><br>We welcome everyone to share any ideas and creativity in the comments section or discuss them in the group! Your suggestions are the core driving force for making the game better!",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Dream</strong></h2>You had a dream, but you discovered you can't wake up.<br><br>In this strange dreamscape woven from Chinese nostalgia, childhood memories, and liminal spaces, everything reasonable yet unreasonable will happen. You can only explore step by step and finally choose whether to return to that bustling, real-world city...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Styles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Core:</strong> Chinese Dreamcore, Liminal Space, Nostalgic Tear-jerker<br></li><li> <strong>Other Styles:</strong> Kidcore, Oldcore, Concretecore, Toiletcore, Frutiger Aero, Y2K</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Gameplay</strong></h2>The core of &quot;Strange Dream&quot; is immersive atmospheric exploration, but it is by no means limited to a walking simulator. Scattered throughout the dream are various fun minigame levels waiting for you to discover. Every exploration may bring an unexpected surprise.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Us to Build the Dream Together!</strong></h2><strong>Game Updates/Discussion QQ Group: 1032181602</strong><br><br>To all our backers and viewers! The game is expected to be released on October 29th. Before the release, there will be a giveaway event for free activation codes! The more wishlists we get, the more codes we'll give away! Please be sure to join the group to see the announcements~<br><br>We welcome everyone to share any ideas and creativity in the comments section or discuss them in the group! Your suggestions are the core driving force for making the game better!",
        "short_description": "You are trapped in a strange dream from which there is no waking. It is stitched from Chinese nostalgia, childhood echoes, and liminal spaces—where sense and nonsense blend freely. All you can do is keep exploring, until you must choose: return to restless reality, or stay in the dream forever?",
        "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
